{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"mcp__figma__get_metadata_2_10cac6e9","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"7:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3155\">\n    <frame id=\"7:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"7:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"7:5\" name=\"Expenio — personal expense manager\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"7:6\" name=\"Design Expenio, a personal expense manager: get started, check your balance and spending, open your wallet, add a new card, pay a friend and keep the receipt. Canvas 375 × 812, iPhone, light mode. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"7:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 6 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the logo, illustrations, card artwork, avatars, merchant and card-network marks and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1145\">\n      <text id=\"7:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"7:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1056\">\n        <frame id=\"7:14\" name=\"01_Get_Started\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"7:15\" name=\"01_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"136\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:16\" name=\"Goal: Understand what Expenio is and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:18\" name=\"• Actions: “Get Started” • App: Logo_Expenio • Copy: “Going cashless has never been easier with the world’s leading expense manager.” • Media: Illustration_Get_Started\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"7:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:20\" name=\"→ Get Started → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:21\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"7:22\" name=\"02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"84\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:23\" name=\"Goal: See my balance, spending trend and latest transactions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:25\" name=\"• Actions: open balance (Icon_Chevron_Right) · “See all” · new payment (Icon_Plus) • Balance: “My Balance” · $25,520.00 • Expenses: “Expenses” chart, MAR – AUG, JUN highlighted at $80.40 • Greeting: “Hello, Maria” · “Home” · Avatar_Maria_Lopez • Transactions: “Wallet” · 3 rows (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"100\" />\n          <text id=\"7:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"226\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:27\" name=\"→ open balance / See all → 03_Wallet → new payment → 05_Payment\" x=\"24\" y=\"252\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:28\" name=\"03_Wallet\" x=\"0\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"7:29\" name=\"03_Wallet\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"89\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:30\" name=\"Goal: Review my card, an offer and my transactions.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:32\" name=\"• Actions: “Back” (Icon_Back) · add card (Icon_Add_Card) • Card: Maria’s Visa card (see DATA) · card 1 of 3 in the wallet • Header: “Wallet” • Promo: “POPULAR” · “Get up to 15% cashback on clothing and apparel” (Promo_Cashback) • Transactions: “Transactions” · 3 rows (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"7:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:34\" name=\"→ Back → 02_Home → add card → 04_Add_Card\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:35\" name=\"04_Add_Card\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"7:36\" name=\"04_Add_Card\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"120\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:37\" name=\"Goal: Add a new payment card.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:39\" name=\"• Actions: close (Icon_Close) · “Add new card” • Card preview: shows the number typed so far (see DATA, Logo_Mastercard); name and expiry not yet entered • Form: “Card holder’s name” (empty, placeholder “Name on card”) · “Card number” 5412 7534 0089 2216, focused, Mastercard detected (Logo_Mastercard) · “Expiry Date” (empty, placeholder “MM / YY”) · “CVV” (empty, placeholder “123”, help Icon_Help) • Header: “Add new card” • Presentation: sheet over 03_Wallet\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"7:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:41\" name=\"→ Add new card / close → 03_Wallet\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:42\" name=\"05_Payment\" x=\"0\" y=\"720\" width=\"644\" height=\"336\">\n          <text id=\"7:43\" name=\"05_Payment\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"110\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:44\" name=\"Goal: Pay Robert $50.00 with my card.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:46\" name=\"• Actions: “Cancel” · “Pay now” • Amount: $50.00 • Card: Maria’s Visa card (as on 03_Wallet) · card 1 of 3 • Header: “Payment” • Note: “Add a note” (empty) • Payee: “PAYING” · “Robert Dawson” (Avatar_Robert_Dawson)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"7:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:48\" name=\"→ Pay now → 06_Receipt → Cancel → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"7:49\" name=\"06_Receipt\" x=\"668\" y=\"720\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"7:50\" name=\"06_Receipt\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"7:51\" name=\"Goal: Confirm what I paid.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"7:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:53\" name=\"• Actions: share (Icon_Share) · “Home” • Header: “Receipt” • Receipt: “CASH RECEIPT” · 20.08.2020 · Amount · Service Fee · Internet Charge · Total · barcode (Barcode_Receipt) (see DATA)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"7:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"7:55\" name=\"→ Home → 02_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:56\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"1725\" width=\"1312\" height=\"117\">\n      <text id=\"7:57\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:58\" name=\"• Flow: 01_Get_Started → Get Started → 02_Home. From 02: open balance or See all → 03_Wallet; new payment → 05_Payment → Pay now → 06_Receipt → Home → 02_Home. • 04_Add_Card is a sheet over 03_Wallet. There is no tab bar in this task. • Entry only (no frame): transaction rows, chart points, the promo, other cards in the wallet, share, typing a note.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"66\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"7:59\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"1890\" width=\"1312\" height=\"512\">\n      <text id=\"7:60\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"7:61\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n   