l triangle below pill? skip; add dot at (182.6,40.2): ellipse 12×12 white fill, stroke brand 3, x=176.6,y=34.2.\n\nAlso faint gridline? add baseline line 311×1 fill #EEE at y=118.\n\nMonth labels: [\"MAR\",\"APR\",\"MAY\",\"JUN\",\"JUL\",\"AUG\"], text 10 Medium gray (JUN brand SemiBold), w=34 align center @x-17, y=126.\n\nChart total height 150.\n\nGood. Write Call A now. Also include `figma.currentPage.selection`? not needed.\n\nI'll return ids: {row, card, promo, chart, fieldFocused, fieldCompact, header}.\n\nAlso Button comp id = '1:23', TextField '1:26', StatusBar '1:33', HomeInd '1:44' (already known).\n\nMedia comp ids known.\n\nCall A code length fine.\n\nOne concern: creating components requires them to be direct children of page (createComponent adds to current page). Then I set comp.x/y.\n\nFor nested instance inside component (merchant logo inside row comp) — fine.\n\nFor TransactionRow default content: Nike row as default.\n\nPaymentCard uses Card_Texture_Coral instance: inst.resize(345,200). Visa logo inst resize(62,20.1)→ resize(62,20).\n\nText \"BALANCE\" letterSpacing: {unit:'PERCENT', value:8}.\n\nNumber \"4225 9765 0008 6141\" letterSpacing {unit:'PERCENT', value:4}.\n\nOK writing now. Also, after creating everything in Call A, I should verify with a screenshot of components area? Later via screen builds.\n\nLet me carefully write the JS.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40af89c4-d68b-44d7-a56d-c7fe152ae445","uuid":"3183ca94-aa95-499a-a9d9-e451ed5d09ef","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:20:14.307Z","thinking_duration_ms":285442}
