{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":36741,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"021f6ae686cb0a7a73ccbee7acbd7ec0","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Screens 1 and 2 built. Now screens 03_Wallet and 04_Add_Card.\n\n03_Wallet (x=1000):\n- Shell\n- Header Nav instance (10:55) at y=56: left Icon_Back, title 'Wallet', right Icon_Add_Card. Set right instance to visible — default is already Add_Card. Left default is Back. \n- Card: Payment Card instance (10:8) at x=16, y=116.\n- \"card 1 of 3\": pagination dots below card: 3 dots, first active (brand color pill wider). y≈328.\n- Promo: 'POPULAR' heading? No — Promo card instance 10:31 at x=16, y=356 (h=96).\n- Transactions: title 'Transactions' y=476, rows card y=508 (3 rows → 216h). Ends 724. OK.\n\n04_Add_Card (x=1500): full frame 375x812. Scrim + sheet.\n- Base: replicate wallet content dimmed: I'll clone 03_Wallet frame? Simpler: create the screen frame with wallet-like background — actually to keep effort manageable, create frame, add shell, then add scrim rect (full 375x812, black 40%) over bg, then sheet.\n- But visually the sheet should be over the wallet screen. Cloning the wallet frame and adding scrim + sheet is the cleanest. I can clone f3 after building it. Clone keeps instances. Then append scrim and sheet to the clone. Sheet must be above scrim in z-order.\n\nSheet content:\n- sheet frame: x=0, y=812-676=136? Let me compute heights: grabber 24 + header 56 + card 150 + gap 24 + name field 73 + gap 16 + number 73 + gap 16 + compact row 73 + gap 24 + button 56 + bottom pad 20 = 581. Sheet y = 812-581-0 → but home indicator over sheet bottom. Let sheet height = 676 → y=136. Content total 581 + padding top 12 → fits.\n\nWait card preview inside sheet: width 343 h=150? Card component is 343x200 ratio. Preview 343x193? Use 343x150 with resize of instance — distorts texture but it's a gradient so fine? Resizing component instance scales all children incl. text (distorts). Better: build preview as frame manually (not instance): rounded rect 343x170 with coral texture image instance resized as fill? Instance resize distorts but it's just a coral gradient — distortion invisible. But children would stretch too if I resize component instance — the component instance children scale proportionally? In Figma, resizing an instance scales it uniformly? No — resize() sets width/height and children are positioned per constraints; components created via API have default constraints (top-left), so children won't scale; only frame size changes, texture stays 345x200 and gets clipped if clipsContent... component root clips? Card has clipsContent=true, so making it 343x150 clips bottom, cutting texts. Bad.\n\nFor the preview I'll construct manually in the sheet:\n- rect 343x170, cornerRadius 18, fill: use texture instance 343x150? Texture is gradient image-like (likely vector/rectangle fills). Let me just use a coral gradient fill + Visa logo + number text + placeholders.\n  Actually better to use the Card_Texture_Coral artwork: create frame 343x170 clip, add texture instance resized to 343x170 (gradient distortion negligible).\n- Content: top-right Mastercard logo (white bg pill behind? MC logo on coral fine), number text '5412 7534 0089 2216' white centered vertically-ish, bottom: 'CARD HOLDER' '— —' and 'EXPIRY' 'MM/YY' placeholders white 60%.\n\nSheet header: 'Add new card' title + close icon right (Icon_Close). Grabber on top.\nForm:\n- Name field: instance of Text Field (1:26) 343x73 — default label 'Card holder’s name' + placeholder 'Name on card'. \n- Card number: instance of Field Focused (10:37).\n- Expiry + CVV: two instances of Field Compact (10:47): left label 'Expiry Date' placeholder 'MM / YY', hide help icon (visible=false on instance child); right: label 'CVV', placeholder '123', help icon visible.\n  Instance child text edits: children[0] label, children[2] placeholder, children[3] help icon.\n- Button: 'Add new card' — Button instance with label changed.\n\nLet me build 03 and 04 now.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40af89c4-d68b-44d7-a56d-c7fe152ae445","uuid":"24545a8f-1e92-4c42-b724-9eb0311b63ad","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:25:14.564Z","thinking_duration_ms":27349}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":36741,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"021f6ae686cb0a7a73ccbee7acbd7ec0","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_19_04f8b9ec","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nfor (const s of ['Regular','Medium','Semi Bold','Bold']) await figma.loadFontAsync({family:'Inter', style:s});\nconst C = {brand:{r:0,g:0.478,b:1}, ink:{r:0.102,g:0.102,b:0.122}, gray:{r:0.557,g:0.557,b:0.576}, bg:{r:0.98,g:0.98,b:0.988}, line:{r:0.925,g:0.925,b:0.94}, green:{r:0.13,g:0.7,b:0.32}, white:{r:1,g:1,b:1}, surface:{r:0.949,g:0.949,b:0.969}};\nconst solid=(c,o=1)=>[{type:'SOLID',color:c,opacity:o}];\nconst cardShadow=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0.07,g:0.09,b:0.16,a:0.07},offset:{x:0,y:8},radius:24,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\nfunction txt(str,size,style,color){const t=figma.createText();t.fontName={family:'Inter',style};t.characters=str;t.fontSize=size;t.fills=solid(color);return t;}\nasync function instOf(id,w,h){const comp=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=comp.createInstance();if(w&&h)i.resize(w,h);return i;}\nasync function shell(f){const sb=await instOf('1:33');sb.x=0;sb.y=0;f.appendChild(sb);const hi=await instOf('1:44');hi.x=0;hi.y=778;f.appendChild(hi);}\nfunction screen(name,x){const f=figma.createFrame();f.name=name;f.resize(375,812);f.x=x;f.y=0;f.fills=solid(C.bg);f.clipsContent=true;page.appendChild(f);return f;}\nasync function txRow(parent,x,y,d){\n  const rowI = await instOf('10:2'); rowI.x=x; rowI.y=y; parent.appendChild(rowI);\n  const icon = rowI.children[0]; icon.children[0].visible=false;\n  const lg = await instOf(d.icon, d.iw, d.ih); parent.appendChild(lg); lg.x=x+16+(40-d.iw)/2; lg.y=y+12+(40-d.ih)/2;\n  rowI.children[1].characters=d.title; rowI.children[2].characters=d.date; rowI.children[3].characters=d.amt;\n  if(!d.neg) rowI.children[3].fills=solid(C.green);\n  return rowI;\n}\nconst TX=[{icon:'5:9',iw:18,ih:18,title:'Nike Air Max 2090',date:'15 Aug 2020',amt:'−$243.00',neg:true},{icon:'5:5',iw:20,ih:15,title:'iPad Pro 2020',date:'10 Aug 2020',amt:'−$799.00',neg:true},{icon:'5:7',iw:22,ih:13,title:'Uber',date:'5 Mar 2020',amt:'+$50.00',neg:false}];\n\n// ============ 03_Wallet ============\nconst f3 = screen('03_Wallet', 1000);\nawait shell(f3);\nconst nav3 = await instOf('10:55'); nav3.x=0; nav3.y=52; nav3.name='Header'; f3.appendChild(nav3);\nconst cardI = await instOf('10:8'); cardI.x=16; cardI.y=112; cardI.name='Maria Visa Card'; f3.appendChild(cardI);\n// pagination dots: card 1 of 3\nfor (let i=0;i<3;i++){\n  const d = figma.createRectangle(); d.cornerRadius=3;\n  if (i===0){ d.resize(18,6); d.fills=solid(C.brand); d.x=167.5; }\n  else { d.resize(6,6); d.fills=solid(C.line); d.x = i===1?191.5:203.5; }\n  d.y=326; f3.appendChild(d);\n}\nconst promoI = await instOf('10:31'); promoI.x=16; promoI.y=352; promoI.name='Promo'; f3.appendChild(promoI);\nconst tT = txt('Transactions', 17, 'Semi Bold', C.ink); tT.x=16; tT.y=476; f3.appendChild(tT);\nconst txCard3 = figma.createFrame(); txCard3.resize(343,216); txCard3.cornerRadius=20; txCard3.x=16; txCard3.y=508; txCard3.fills=solid(C.white); txCard3.effects=cardShadow; txCard3.clipsContent=true; txCard3.name='Transactions'; f3.appendChild(txCard3);\nfor (let i=0;i<3;i++){ await txRow(txCard3,0,i*72,TX[i]); if(i<2){const div=figma.createRectangle();div.resize(255,1);div.x=72;div.y=71+i*72;div.fills=solid(C.line);txCard3.appendChild(div);} }\n\n// ============ 04_Add_Card (sheet over wallet) ============\nconst f4 = screen('04_Add_Card', 1500);\n// dimmed wallet backdrop: reuse simplified wallet bg\nconst scrim = figma.createRectangle(); scrim.resize(375,812); scrim.x=0; scrim.y=0; scrim.fills=solid({r:0.05,g:0.06,b:0.09},0.45); scrim.name='Scrim';\nconst nav4 = await instOf('10:55'); nav4.x=0; nav4.y=52; nav4.name='Header'; f4.appendChild(nav4);\nconst cardI4 = await instOf('10:8'); cardI4.x=16; cardI4.y=112; cardI4.name='Maria Visa Card'; f4.appendChild(cardI4);\nf4.appendChild(scrim);\n// Sheet\nconst sheet = figma.createFrame(); sheet.name='Add Card Sheet'; sheet.resize(375,676); sheet.x=0; sheet.y=136;\nsheet.cornerRadius=24; sheet.fills=solid(C.white); sheet.clipsContent=true;\nsheet.effects=[{type:'DROP_SHADOW',color:{r:0,g:0,b:0,a:0.25},offset:{x:0,y:-8},radius:32,spread:0,visible:true,blendMode:'NORMAL'}];\nf4.appendChild(sheet);\nconst grab = figma.createRectangle(); grab.resize(40,5); grab.cornerRadius=2.5; grab.x=167.5; grab.y=10; grab.fills=solid(C.line); sheet.appendChild(grab);\nconst shT = txt('Add new card', 17, 'Semi Bold', C.ink); shT.x=16; shT.y=34; sheet.appendChild(shT);\nconst closeI = await instOf('6:7', 24, 24); closeI.x=335; closeI.y=30; closeI.name='Close'; sheet.appendChild(closeI);\n// Card preview\nconst pv = figma.createFrame(); pv.name='Card Preview'; pv.resize(343,150); pv.x=16; pv.y=74; pv.cornerRadius=18; pv.clipsContent=true; pv.fills=solid({r:0.85,g:0.4,b:0.35}); sheet.appendChild(pv);\nconst tex4 = await instOf('5:10', 343, 200); tex4.y=-25; pv.appendChild(tex4);\nconst mc4 = await instOf('6:11', 40, 27); mc4.x=343-16-40; mc4.y=16; pv.appendChild(mc4);\nconst pvNum = txt('5412 7534 0089 2216', 17, 'Medium', C.white); pvNum.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT', value:6}; pvNum.x=16; pvNum.y=66; pv.appendChild(pvNum);\nconst pvH = txt('CARD HOLDER  ·  —', 9, 'Medium', C.white); pvH.opacity=0.75; pvH.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT', value:8}; pvH.x=16; pvH.y=118; pv.appendChild(pvH);\nconst pvE = txt('EXPIRY  ·  MM/YY', 9, 'Medium', C.white); pvE.opacity=0.75; pvE.letterSpacing={unit:'PERCENT', value:8}; pvE.x=258; pvE.y=118; pv.appendChild(pvE);\n// Form\nconst fldName = await instOf('1:26', 343, 73); fldName.x=16; fldName.y=248; fldName.name=\"Card holder's name\"; sheet.appendChild(fldName);\nconst fldNum = await instOf('10:37'); fldNum.x=16; fldNum.y=337; fldNum.name='Card number'; sheet.appendChild(fldNum);\nconst fldExp = await instOf('10:47'); fldExp.x=16; fldExp.y=426; fldExp.name='Expiry Date'; sheet.appendChild(fldExp);\nfldExp.children[3].visible = false;\nconst fldCvv = await instOf('10:47'); fldCvv.x=195; fldCvv.y=426; fldCvv.name='CVV'; sheet.appendChild(fldCvv);\nfldCvv.children[0].characters='CVV'; fldCvv.children[2].characters='123';\nconst btn4 = await instOf('1:23', 343, 56); btn4.x=16; btn4.y=540; btn4.name='Add new card'; sheet.appendChild(btn4);\nbtn4.children[0].characters='Add new card';\nawait shell(f4);\nreturn {f3:f3.id, f4:f4.id};","description":"Build 03_Wallet and 04_Add_Card screens","fileKey":"OHClunQ9Zd1sWb1qp1X84s"}}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"40af89c4-d68b-44d7-a56d-c7fe152ae445","uuid":"747379f8-8182-440d-b757-e6078a1d0d40","timestamp":"2026-11-01T00:25:48.937Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"mcp__figma__use_figma_19_04f8b9ec","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
