{"type":"assistant","message":{"type":"message","model":"kimi-k3","usage":{"input_tokens":67029,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_5_m_tokens":0,"claude_cache_creation_1_h_tokens":0},"role":"assistant","id":"080b6ae697c30a7a075078c1007aeae1","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Reasoning summary: All 6 screens are built in 03 · Workspace with exact fixed data/copy, media components reused as instances, reusable Expenio components created, and the full prototype flow wired (verified 11 reaction nodes across all 6 frames). Reference pages were left untouched.\n\nFinal answer:\n\n交付完成 — Expenio 个人记账 App（375 × 812，浅色模式，Inter，品牌色 #007AFF）\n\n**文件**: https://www.figma.com/design/OHClunQ9Zd1sWb1qp1X84s/\n**交付页面**: 03 · Workspace (page ID `8:2`)\n\n**6 个屏幕 Frame**\n- `01_Get_Started` — `13:12`（插画 + EXPENIO Logo + 标语 + Get Started）\n- `02_Home` — `13:32`(Hello Maria/头像/+, My Balance $25,520.00 + chevron, Expenses 图表 MAR–AUG、JUN 高亮 $80.40, Wallet/See all + 3 条交易）\n- `03_Wallet` — `14:65`（返回/添加卡，Maria Visa 卡 $25,520.00 · 4225 9765 0008 6141 · 09/24，1/3 圆点，POPULAR promo, 3 条交易）\n- `04_Add_Card` — `14:130`（底部 sheet 覆盖 Wallet，卡预览实时显示卡号 + Mastercard，卡号聚焦态，name/expiry/CVV 空态，Add new card 按钮）\n- `05_Payment` — `16:166`(Cancel, PAYING Robert Dawson 头像， $50.00, Visa 卡 1/3, Add a note, Pay now)\n- `06_Receipt` — `16:210`(Share, CASH RECEIPT · 20.08.2020, Amount/Service Fee/Internet Charge/Total $50.00, 条形码， Home)\n\n**可复用组件**（建于 Workspace):Transaction Row、Payment Card、Expenses Chart、Promo Card、Field Focused（聚焦卡号）、Field Compact、Header Nav；均复用 02/04 页给定的 Button、Text Field、状态栏、Home Indicator 及全部素材实例。\n\n**原型连线（11 处，已验证）**:01→02(Get Started);02→03(Open balance、See all）与 02→05(New payment/+);03→02(Back）与 03→04(Add card);04→03(Close、Add new card);05→02(Cancel）与 05→06(Pay now);06→02(Home)。过渡使用 PUSH / SLIDE_OUT / MOVE_IN（底部弹层）。\n\n**限制**:Figma 的 set_reactions 只接受 NAVIGATE 类型转换，04 的 sheet 呈现以静态视觉（scrim + 圆角 sheet）表达而非真正的 overlay 交互；